# Presentation HTTP

## Role

Wire adapt only: AJV validate → request map → application UC → response map.  
Auth via guards + `@Authorize` / `@PublicEndpoint`.

## Folders

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `http/controllers/` | Thin `*.controller.ts` |
| `http/validation/schemas/` | AJV schemas + types |
| `http/request-mappers/` | HTTP → UC input / FindManyParams |
| `http/http-responses/` | UC output → `{ data, meta? }` |
| `web-socket/` | Gateways (transport only) |
| guards / decorators | auth/authorization feature |

## Forbidden

- Prisma / repository ports
- Domain ACL policies / business invariants
- Ad-hoc select field lists that duplicate domain `*_SELECT_FIELDS` as a second SoT
- Prefix `payload-to-*` for request mappers (use `request-body-to-*` / `request-query-params-to-*` / `request-params-to-*`)

